JSON files normally use the.jsonextension.

Use thefetch()method to request the JSON file.

Theresponse.json()method parses the JSON text and returns a JavaScript value.

If the file contains a JSON array,response.json()returns a JavaScript array.

Thefetch()method does not throw an error forHTTP errorssuch as 404.

Check theokandstatusproperties before reading the JSON file.

